Subject: [PATCH 176/488] soh: rename D_809A5178 -> sShockDL

Name source: zeldaret/oot (same decomp, same ROM address).
Structure verified against upstream at 1.00.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Fhg_Flash/z_eff_ss_fhg_flash.c.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Fhg_Flash/z_eff_ss_fhg_flash.c   | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Fhg_Flash/z_eff_ss_fhg_flash.c b/soh/src/overlays/effects/ovl_Effect_Ss_Fhg_Flash/z_eff_ss_fhg_flash.c
